---
import { ArrowUpRight, Feather } from "@lucide/astro";
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { formatDateTime } from "../../lib/date-time";
import { listPublishedNovelFragments } from "../../lib/public-api";

const fragments = await listPublishedNovelFragments();
---

<BaseLayout
  title="小说片段"
  description="Speaive 偶尔写下的小说片段：人物、场景、对话，以及尚未长成完整故事的灵感。"
>
  <header class="novel-library-hero">
    <div class="shell novel-library-hero-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="section-label">Fiction fragments</p>
        <h1>未完待续，<br />也可以先被看见。</h1>
      </div>
      <div class="novel-library-note">
        <Feather size={24} stroke-width={1.5} aria-hidden="true" />
        <p>这里保存突然出现的人物、场景和句子。它们未必已经准备好成为一本书，但被写下来时，都曾经真实地发生在想象里。</p>
        <span>{fragments.length.toString().padStart(2, "0")} 份公开片段</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="novel-library-section">
    <div class="shell">
      {fragments.length > 0 ? (
        <ol class="novel-public-list">
          {fragments.map((fragment, index) => (
            <li>
              <a href={`/novels/${encodeURIComponent(fragment.slug)}/`}>
                <span class="novel-public-index" aria-hidden="true">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, "0")}</span>
                <div class="novel-public-copy">
                  <span class="novel-public-label">Fragment</span>
                  <h2>{fragment.title}</h2>
                  <p>{fragment.excerpt || "一段尚未被解释的故事。"}</p>
                  <div>
                    <span>{fragment.author.displayName}</span>
                    <time datetime={fragment.publishedAt.toISOString()}>{formatDateTime(fragment.publishedAt)}</time>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <span class="novel-public-open" aria-hidden="true"><ArrowUpRight size={20} stroke-width={1.5} /></span>
              </a>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ol>
      ) : (
        <div class="novel-public-empty">
          <Feather size={30} stroke-width={1.3} aria-hidden="true" />
          <h2>故事还在暗处生长</h2>
          <p>暂时没有公开片段。等它愿意被看见时，会出现在这里。</p>
        </div>
      )}
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
